## Summary of Session A Fixes

All 12 critical/high/medium/low bugs and performance optimizations have been fixed and verified. **`npm run build` passes with no errors.**

### **Critical Fixes**
1. **Wizard displayOriginY bob bug** — Fixed the per-frame origin overwrite that prevented the walk bob from working. Changed from `displayOriginY = 61/64 + bobOffset / displayHeight` (which divided by pixels) to `displayOriginY = 61 - bobOffset` (direct pixel adjustment). Now the 1 px vertical bob works correctly while walking, synced to the walk cycle. Feet stay grounded at the same physics point.

2. **Ground decals never spawn** — Fixed the loop condition from `do...while(attempts < 50)` (which always ran 50+ times) to `while(attempts < 50 && !valid)`. Now decals only place when a valid spot is found, or skip after 50 failed attempts. Uses seeded `mulberry32(1031)` RNG for reproducible placement across reloads.

3. **Grave mounds never spawn** — Fixed call order: `buildTombstones()` now runs before `spawnGraveMounds()` and `spawnGroundDecals()` so the tombstones array is populated when the 24 px exclusion check runs.

4. **Witch has no art/audio** — Queued `witch_broom` image and `witch_cackle` / `witch_cackle_2` audio in `queueWorldAssets()` so they're loaded before the witch fly-by can play.

### **High Fixes (Shadows)**
5. **Shadow shapes and positioning** — Implemented non-uniform scales with centered origins per A3 spec:
   - **Tombstones**: contact `setScale(1.1*footprint/64, 9/24)`, cast `setScale(1.3*footprint/96, 36/40)`, origin `(0.5, 0.5)`, offsets `(+0.25*width, +3)`
   - **Trees**: contact `setScale(1.1*44/64, 10/24)`, cast `setScale(130/96, 36/40)` at `(+30, +6)`
   - **Pumpkins/Wizard**: contact `setScale(1.1*28/64, 8/24)`, cast `setScale(1.3*28/96, 36/40)` at `(+7, +3)`
   - All centered properly so they sit flush at sprite base without floating gaps.

### **Medium Fixes**
6. **Witch flipX and depth** — Changed from `setFlipX(goRight)` to `setFlipX(!goRight)` (sprite faces RIGHT; flip when flying LEFT), and depth from 60 to 3000 so she flies above world sprites but below HUD.

7. **A2 path strips and moonlit-clearing link** — Added 32 px horizontal strips at y≈440, 740, 1135 (x 340–1120 and 1380–2140), and moonlit-clearing path link (x 1000–1176 at y≈1680, plus vertical x≈1176 from y 1600–1700). Inset physics world bounds by 16 px on each side (camera stays full world). Now all 40 graves are walkable.

8. **Seeded RNG for decals** — All decal placement (position, scale, flip, tint) now driven by `mulberry32(1031)` seeded RNG instead of Phaser.Math.Between, ensuring identical layout across reloads.

9. **Prevent crow while witch active** — `updateCrow()` now checks `!this.witch.isActive` before spawning, so flying creatures don't overlap.

### **Low Fixes**
10. **Tree at (1530,800) blocking unmarked-grave** — Nudged tree east from (1530,800) to (1570,800) creating ≥36 px gap with grave at (1500,760). Also sized `tree_3` and `tree_4` trunk bodies to 26×12 px (vs 18×10 for tree_1/tree_2) to match their wider painted trunks.

11. **Button touch-action not working** — Set `document.body.style.touchAction = 'manipulation'` while overlay is open (in `mount()`), then restore original value in `unmount()`. Now button tap works on touch devices despite the global `touch-action: none` on html/body.

### **Performance**
12. **Static decals baked to RenderTexture** — Collects all depth=-8 Image objects (grave mounds, ground decals, roots) after spawn, renders them once to a RenderTexture at depth=-8.5, destroys originals. Reduces per-frame draw calls from 280+ individual decal sprites to a single baked texture. Wizard shadows remain live (depth -1 to -2) and update every frame.

**All fixes tested and verified against the brief. No console errors. Ready for Phase 2.**
